#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_Katsuragi"
msgid "All right, let's get down to business."
msgstr "...Bien, entonces, pasemos al tema principal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Katsuragi"
msgid "Tanimura-san. You said you wanted to know\\r\nthe truth about what happened to your father."
msgstr "Tanimura-san, dijiste que querías saber la verdad\\r\nsobre la muerte de tu padre, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Tanimura"
msgid "Yeah... About how he was murdered."
msgstr "Sí... Sobre cómo fue asesinado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_Tanimura"
msgid "It had something to do with the attempt on\\r\nYoshiharu Ueno's life 25 years ago, right?"
msgstr "¿No estará relacionado con el ataque a Yoshikazu\\r\nUeno de hace 25 años?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Katsuragi"
msgid "I'm not one to beat around the bush,\\r\nso I'll just say it. You're mistaken."
msgstr "No soy de andar con rodeos, así que lo\\r\ndiré claramente. ...Estás equivocado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Tanimura"
msgid "Oh really? Heh, maybe you didn't know,\\r\nbut I was there when Arai killed Shibata."
msgstr "¿Qué me estás diciendo? ¿Que no es cierto?\\r\n...Yo estuve presente cuando Arai mató a Shibata."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_Tanimura"
msgid "Your trigger man said it himself,\\r\nthat you and Shibata were connected."
msgstr "Sé que tú y Shibata estaban conectados\\r\ncon el caso de hace veinticinco años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Tanimura"
msgid "My dad risked his life to find out\\r\nthat connection on his own."
msgstr "...Mi padre se dio cuenta de que ese incidente\\r\nfue algo que tú y Shibata planearon..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "192_Tanimura"
msgid "And that's what got him killed. Isn't it?"
msgstr "Y se supone que lo mataron debido a eso, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Katsuragi"
msgid "There is some truth to that, Tanimura-san..."
msgstr "Hay algo de verdad en eso, Tanimura-san..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Katsuragi"
msgid "Namely, that your father did his homework\\r\non Shibata and I regarding the past incident."
msgstr "Tu padre descubrió que Shibata y yo estábamos\\r\ninvolucrados en aquel incidente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Katsuragi"
msgid "In fact, the two of us authored that script."
msgstr "Shibata y yo fuimos los autores de aquel incidente de hace veinticinco años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_Katsuragi"
msgid "So I knew the exact time and place\\r\nTaiga Saejima would fulfill his duty."
msgstr "...Yo sabía que ese día, a esa hora,\\r\nTaiga Saejima vendría solo a realizar el ataque."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Tanimura"
msgid "Hold up. You're telling me you planned on\\r\nbeing a victim... of a shooting you set up?"
msgstr "Espera un momento... ¿No fuiste tú una de\\r\nlas víctimas en aquel incidente?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Tanimura"
msgid "How did you think you'd survive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo lograste sobrevivir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Katsuragi"
msgid "Didn't I just tell you?"
msgstr "Je... Ya lo sabía, ¿no te lo acabo de decir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "288_Katsuragi"
msgid "I knew every last detail of how\\r\nSaejima would attack in advance."
msgstr "...Yo estaba al tanto de cómo\\r\nSaejima llevaría a cabo el ataque."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Tanimura"
msgid "You wore body armor?"
msgstr "¿Llevabas un chaleco antibalas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Katsuragi"
msgid "Something like that. Let's just say I was\\r\nthorough with my preparations. That's all."
msgstr "Más o menos. Me preparé con anticipación,\\r\npor eso pude sobrevivir. Eso es todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_Tanimura"
msgid "So, you conspired with Shibata to eliminate your\\r\nfamily's officers and make it look like a Tojo hit."
msgstr "Así que tú y Shibata conspiraron para asesinar a los oficiales\\r\nde tu familia, haciéndolo parecer un ataque del Tojo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_Tanimura"
msgid "And you did this knowing you could end up dead?"
msgstr "A pesar de la posibilidad de que murieras tú también."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Katsuragi"
msgid "At the time, I was only 22.\\r\nShibata himself was 30."
msgstr "En ese entonces, yo tenía 22 años\\r\ny Shibata, 30."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Katsuragi"
msgid "Both of us understood that rising up the ranks at\\r\nour age meant decisive action had to be taken."
msgstr "Los dos sabíamos que para ascender en la organización\\r\na nuestra edad era necesario actuar con decisión."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Tanimura"
msgid "You did become a lieutenant in the Ueno Seiwa.\\r\nAnd Shibata rose to the top of the Tojo."
msgstr "Lograste convertirte en teniente en el Ueno Seiwa.\\r\nY Shibata llegó a lo más alto del Tojo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Tanimura"
msgid "I'd say your plan was a success."
msgstr "Yo diría que su plan fue un éxito."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Katsuragi"
msgid "That would be an accurate conclusion."
msgstr "Supongo que sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Tanimura"
msgid "You seem rather nonchalant about all this."
msgstr "...¿Por qué lo dices con tanta ligereza?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Katsuragi"
msgid "Well, it has been 25 years."
msgstr "Bueno, ya han pasado 25 años desde eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Katsuragi"
msgid "I could give you a play-by-play down to the\\r\nminute, and the police still couldn't touch me."
msgstr "...incluso si la policía se entera de\\r\nesto, no tengo nada que temer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "468_Tanimura"
msgid "True, the statute of limitations would apply...\\r\nAs long as you kept your hands clean."
msgstr "Es cierto, la ley de prescripción aplicaría...\\r\npero en la yakuza eso no existe."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Tanimura"
msgid "That's why you used Yasuko-san to eliminate\\r\nShibata's men, and Arai to wipe out their boss."
msgstr "Por eso manipulaste a Yasuko para que eliminara a los hombres\\r\nde Shibata y luego ordenaste a Arai que matara a Shibata."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_Tanimura"
msgid "Sound about right?"
msgstr "Así que eso es lo que pasó..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_Katsuragi"
msgid "Yes, I suppose it does."
msgstr "Pues sí, supongo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Tanimura"
msgid "Though I doubt you'd admit your involvement\\r\nin court... Fine, let's get back on track."
msgstr "¿Vas a seguir insistiendo en que no fuiste tú el autor intelectual?\\r\n...Bueno, no importa. Volvamos al tema."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Tanimura"
msgid "Why did my father have to die 25 years ago?\\r\nI want a real answer."
msgstr "¿Por qué era necesario que mi padre muriera hace 25 años?\\r\nQuiero una respuesta real."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Katsuragi"
msgid "Your father, the Tanimura-san of my generation,\\r\nhad discovered Shibata and I were behind the hit."
msgstr "Tu padre... el Tanimura-san de mi generación, había\\r\ndescubierto que Shibata y yo estábamos detrás del ataque."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Katsuragi"
msgid "But he stumbled onto something even bigger\\r\nduring his investigation."
msgstr "Pero en el proceso de esa investigación, descubrió\\r\nalgo aún más grande."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "564_Tanimura"
msgid "And what exactly was that?"
msgstr "¿Y qué fue lo que descubrió?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Katsuragi"
msgid "Corruption."
msgstr "...Corrupción."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Katsuragi"
msgid "Digging in deeper led him to uncover corruption\\r\nwithin the upper echelons of the police force."
msgstr "...Tu padre, mientras investigaba el caso, descubrió\\r\nla corrupción dentro de la policía."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Tanimura"
msgid "Corruption... in the force?"
msgstr "¿Corrupción... en la policía?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "624_Katsuragi"
msgid "You may not know this, but the police\\r\nstaged a cover-up of the hit."
msgstr "...Puede que esto te sorprenda, pero\\r\nla policía encubrió el ataque."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "636_Katsuragi"
msgid "They concealed the real killer,\\r\nand Taiga Saejima took the fall."
msgstr "...Para ocultar al verdadero asesino\\r\ndel caso, que no es Saejima Taiga."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Tanimura"
msgid "What do you mean by \"real\" killer?"
msgstr "¿El \"verdadero\" asesino... dices?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "660_Katsuragi"
msgid "Just what I said. Saejima popped our boys with\\r\nbullets, but someone else finished the job."
msgstr "Así es... Taiga Saejima atacó a nuestros hombres,\\r\npero alguien más fue quien los remató."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "672_Tanimura"
msgid "Yasuko-san did mention another\\r\nperpetrator... So you weren't lying."
msgstr "Yasuko-san mencionó a otro perpetrador...\\r\nAsí que no estabas mintiendo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "684_Katsuragi"
msgid "Your old man figured it out pretty quick."
msgstr "Tu padre descubrió la identidad del verdadero asesino y..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "696_Katsuragi"
msgid "What he didn't bargain for was an institution\\r\nthat would purposely bury his work..."
msgstr "Al investigar el caso, descubrió tanto al verdadero\\r\nasesino como la corrupción policial que lo encubrió..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "708_Katsuragi"
msgid "...Let alone bury him along with it."
msgstr "...Por eso lo mataron."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "720_Tanimura"
msgid "Who was it, then!? Who murdered my dad!?\\r\nAnd who finished the hit!?"
msgstr "¡¿Quién demonios es?! ¡¿Quién asesinó a mi padre?!\\r\n¡¿Quién es el verdadero asesino?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Katsuragi"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Je..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "756_Tanimura"
msgid "How long have you been here?"
msgstr "...¿Cuánto tiempo llevas aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "768_Katsuragi"
msgid "Heh, since long before you arrived."
msgstr "Je... Estuve aquí mucho antes de que tú llegaras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "780_Tanimura"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "792_Katsuragi"
msgid "I'd wager you saw me in the crowd, but didn't recognize me."
msgstr "Es probable que me hayas visto en la multitud, pero no me reconociste."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "804_Katsuragi"
msgid "That tells me you don't have much of a file on me. A relief, really."
msgstr "...Eso me dice que no has investigado mucho sobre mí. Eso me tranquiliza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "816_Tanimura"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "828_Katsuragi"
msgid "Now, what will it be? Shall we proceed with the deal?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué hacemos? ¿Seguiremos con el trato aquí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "840_Tanimura"
msgid "No, let's walk and talk."
msgstr "No, ¿por qué no hablamos mientras caminamos un poco?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "852_Katsuragi"
msgid "Here?"
msgstr "¿Caminar, dices?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "864_Tanimura"
msgid "Around. Maybe it'll help jog your memory, y'know? I'm sure you have so much to tell."
msgstr "Sí. ¿Hablemos sobre la verdad de hace 25 años mientras damos un paseo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "876_Katsuragi"
msgid "...You really have thought this through. A moving target is a lot harder to hit."
msgstr "Entiendo. Eres muy astuto... Si nos movemos mientras negociamos, será más difícil que nos localicen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "888_Tanimura"
msgid "Not to mention I thought you'd appreciate a nice, long stroll through Tojo Clan turf."
msgstr "¿No te gustaría caminar por el corazón del territorio del Clan Tojo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "900_Katsuragi"
msgid "How thoughtful of you. Then lead the way, Tanimura-san."
msgstr "Qué considerado. Acepto acompañarle, Masayoshi Tanimura-san."

